<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: vivi egg -->
  <VV_ViviEgg.label>薇薇蜂卵</VV_ViviEgg.label>
  <!-- EN: This is an egg from which a Vivi can be born. It only hatches when placed in a warm incubator between 19-39℃, and the closer the temperature is maintained to 30℃, the faster it hatches.\n\nIf it's in an inadequate temperature, the egg gets damaged but it automatically recovers once the proper environment is restored.\n\nThe born Vivi inherits the mother's xenogenes and additionally, is born with random xenogenes. (Archites are not inherited.)\n\nCaution: Be careful not to accidentally eat it or let passing animals eat it. -->
  <VV_ViviEgg.description>這是一個可以孵出薇薇的蜂卵。只能在19-39℃之間的溫暖孵化器中孵化，溫度越接近30℃，孵化越快。\n\n如果溫度過低，蜂卵會受損，但一旦環境恢復正常，它就會自動恢復。\n\n出生的薇薇會繼承母本的異種基因，且會突變出隨機異種基因（超凡基因不遺傳）\n\n注意：不要意外讓殖民者或路過的動物食用它。</VV_ViviEgg.description>
  
</LanguageData>